{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47152","headline":"赠方干 · 可朋","name":"赠方干","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛名传出自皇州，一举参差便缩头。\n月里岂无攀桂分，湖中刚爱钓鱼休。\n童偷诗藁呈邻叟，客乞书题谒郡侯。\n独泛短舟何限景，波涛西接洞庭秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"可朋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}